vzlogger (0.8.10-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * New upstream release

  [ Joachim Zobel ]
  * d/control: 
    - Bumped Standards-version
    - Removed outdated BD version constraints

  [ Marc Haber ]
  * split off Build-Depends-Arch in debian/control

    This makes it easier to build the source package only, for example for a
    binary build inside sbuild. Build-Depends: must always be satisfied,
    Build-Depends-Arch: only when the architecture dependent binary packages
    are built. So, one just needs debhelper-compat 12, pkgconf, and cmake to
    build the source package. All the library dev packages are only needed
    to build the actual binary package.

  [ Luca Boccassi ]
  * Install and use sysusers.d/tmpfiles.d config files

    sysusers.d/tmpfiles.d config files allow a package to use declarative
    configuration instead of manually written maintainer scripts. This also
    allows image-based systems to be created with /usr/ only, and also
    allows for factory resetting a system and recreating /etc/ on boot.

 -- Joachim Zobel <jz-2017@heute-morgen.de>  Fri, 24 Jul 2026 16:45:56 +0200

